<#e0283c>BLOOD GAUGE / RELEASE</>
Blood Release (blood gauge full)		^X
  Lifesteal bites and Crunch hits fill the blood gauge (bottom of
  the screen). At full, X on the ground spends it: he heals some
  life and enters Release for 11 s. In Release Bat Bullets are
  stronger and throw a second bat, Hell Hand hits harder with
  extra hits, and Colony of Bats hits harder. Then the gauge is
  empty. It cannot refill during Release.
Familiar (gauge not full)		^X
  Calls Tubalcain, Rinkle or the police. Free.

<#e0283c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Run		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#e0283c>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy (gun)		^A / ^B / ^C
Forward Heavy (launcher)		_F^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy (gun)		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy (gun)		^A / ^B / ^C
Taunt		Start

<#e0283c>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter) where it says EX.
Bat Bullets		_B_F^A / ^B / ^C
Crunch (Hellhound)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Crunch Z (EX, 500)		_D_DF_F^C
Lifesteal (command bite)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Lifesteal (EX, 500, longest bite)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^C
  Heals him while it drains them, and fills the blood gauge.
Stalking Vampire (invincible dash, 500)		_F_D_DF^X
Stalking Vampire back (500)		_B_D_DB^X
Immortal Vampire (while blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C / ^X

<#e0283c>SUPERS</>
Colony of Bats (1 bar)		_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Hell Hand (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Hound of Baskerville (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Cromwell: Soul Release (3 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work. In Cromwell form X is Recovery (2 bars):
  a short invincible heal.
